<title>USA: CryoLife Inc sets 500,000 share buyback.</title>
<headline>CryoLife Inc sets 500,000 share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>CryoLife Inc said on Wednesday it will repurchase up to 500,000 common shares, which would represent about 5 percent of the company's total shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The purchases will be made from time to time on the open market. CryoLife shares were trading up 1/4 to 8-1/4 on Wednesday morning, well below their 52-week high of 20-3/4.</p>
<p>CryoLife makes technology to preserve human cells and tissue.</p>
</text>
